Description: Provides beginner-friendly functions for common descriptive and 
    inferential statistical analyses, together with tools for creating 
    publication-ready tables. The package includes summary statistics, 
    distribution checks, group comparisons, correlations, proportions with 
    confidence intervals, rates with confidence intervals, 2x2 tables, and 
    modular table-building workflows. Outputs can be rendered as publication 
    ready  tables.
